{"4406280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "the cabin game", "steam_appid": 4406280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/bed67ac3fd5a5411bead04c4a7c78f0c.poster.avif?t=1787842454\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/bed67ac3fd5a5411bead04c4a7c78f0c.webm?t=1787842454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/bed67ac3fd5a5411bead04c4a7c78f0c.mp4?t=1787842454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/1fcd89d1447dd32d7decb063e9c8297f.webp?t=1787842454\" width=200 height=46 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">the cabin game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are trapped inside this cabin and the only escape is through a game of cards! Use the hands you're dealt to unlock clues hidden throughout the cabin to find the exit. Just beware as the cards you play can alter the cabin around you and have environmental consequences...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/d239e2c5f69567ecaef14034860bce13.webp?t=1787842454\" width=500 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/7fb8b02107aa4137a680bb8063812990.poster.avif?t=1787842454\" width=664 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/7fb8b02107aa4137a680bb8063812990.webm?t=1787842454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/7fb8b02107aa4137a680bb8063812990.mp4?t=1787842454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play alone or play with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together because your lives depend on it! Whether you carry or get carried, everyone's choices impact one another. It's when it comes down to the final hour do you choose to escape together, die together, or every player for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-designed cabin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cabin game doesn't have a one-size map. The rooms of the cabin are laid out as the game progresses, through design of the players. Be careful how you place rooms because as certain events unfold, early game choices can have late game consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll never not NOT  be bored</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety is endless as you never know what events will unfold... or when! The cards are randomly shuffled at the start of every game, making each hand different and every turn can yield unpredictable results! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Boo Factory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect candy as currency and spend it at The Boo Factory! Customize your character, purchase items and pets for your lobby, or buy tricks 'n treats to use in game to mess with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/6fe4408327f59452e82e0be6d35f1e83.webp?t=1787842454\" width=200 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/19f2293f75eba68b116a8ecabb8b55ab.poster.avif?t=1787842454\" width=672 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/19f2293f75eba68b116a8ecabb8b55ab.webm?t=1787842454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/19f2293f75eba68b116a8ecabb8b55ab.mp4?t=1787842454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Photosensitivity Warning:</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the cabin game contains strobing and flashing lights that could cause a small percentage of people to experience seizures when exposed to certain lights, patterns, or images.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/bed67ac3fd5a5411bead04c4a7c78f0c.poster.avif?t=1787842454\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/bed67ac3fd5a5411bead04c4a7c78f0c.webm?t=1787842454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406280/extras/bed67ac3fd5a5411bead04c4a7c78f0c.mp4?t=1787842454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: 